{"lyrics":"[00:10.86]She tell me, \"We forever\", fuck forever, I just wanna fuck forever\n[00:15.86]Off a perky, I could probably fuck forever\n[00:17.98].40 on my hip, that's for whoever (Turn Me Up)\n[00:22.12]He say he gon' kill me, I say “Whatever” (Jamz, Turn Me Up)\n[00:24.66]Niggas talk too much, tell 'em \"Shut the fuck up\", before we shoot the place up\n[00:28.96]He wanna fight? Cool, first, let me smoke my blunt, let me load my gun, pull it out, they run, hey\n[00:35.42]Rockstar lifestyle, I won't make it, bad lil' bitch in the hotel naked\n[00:40.98]She told me that she know that I talk to Satan\n[00:43.94]He say he tryna kill me, baby, keep on prayin'\n[00:46.74]Left my perks in the room, left the shrooms in there too\n[00:49.76]I got nothin' to lose, I don't pity the fool\n[00:52.52]If he keeps on makin' a ruckus, he'll be makin' the news\n[00:55.58]Call my New York nigga up to come to chop 'em in two, ooh\n[00:59.08]You sayin' that you didn't do what you do\n[01:01.30]But my shooters already on you, they gon' do what they do, ooh\n[01:04.98]Look at your bitch, the way she fuckin' the crew\n[01:07.22]The way she fuckin' the crew, she think she part of the crew, cool\n[01:10.94]I told you that I don't got nothing to lose\n[01:13.62]Get fucked up when there's nothin' to do, ooh\n[01:17.20]No handouts, don't got nothin' for you, ooh\n[01:19.48]Gun on my waist I got somethin' to prove, ooh\n[01:22.72]I told you that I don't got nothing to lose\n[01:24.68]Get fucked up when there's nothin' to do, ooh\n[01:28.62]No handouts, don't got nothin' for you, ooh\n[01:31.26]Gun on my waist I got somethin' to prove, ooh\n[01:34.34]I'm in a mood, Cupid ready to shoot\n[01:36.86]Yeah, I'm ready to love, but I ain't ready to lose\n[01:39.68]You got a date with destiny, destiny ready for you\n[01:42.54]These bitches pressin' me, do I look like a button to you? Ooh\n[01:45.58]I was together when it started, now I'm comin' a loose\n[01:48.58]Spit at Cupid in the face, and now I'm runnin' from you\n[01:51.46]I went from talking about guns to lovin' on you\n[01:54.42]I keep it on me 'cause nobody takin' nothing from you, ooh\n[01:58.02]Every song turns to a love song, uh, I think that my life is a love song\n[02:02.94]Fuck around, got so high, it's a drug song, I love drugs, so I guess it's still a love song, hey\n[02:09.66]Every song turns to a love song, uh, I think that my life is a love song\n[02:14.70]Fuck around, got so high, it's a drug song, I love drugs, so I guess it's still a love song, hey\n[02:21.56]I told you that I don't got nothing to lose\n[02:24.30]Get fucked up when there's nothin' to do, ooh\n[02:27.22]No handouts, don't got nothin' for you, ooh\n[02:30.16]Gun on my waist I got somethin' to prove, ooh\n[02:33.34]I told you that I don't got nothing to lose\n[02:36.08]Get fucked up when there's nothin' to do, ooh\n[02:39.12]No handouts, don't got nothin' for you, ooh\n[02:41.94]Gun on my waist I got somethin' to prove, ooh","words":[[10.86,10.92,"She"],[11.04,11.2,"tell"],[11.26,11.3,"me,"],[11.42,11.48,"\"We"],[11.56,12.06,"forever\","],[12.88,13.02,"fuck"],[13.06,13.56,"forever,"],[13.7,13.7,"I"],[13.8,13.94,"just"],[14.0,14.22,"wanna"],[14.32,14.48,"fuck"],[14.52,15.0,"forever"],[15.86,15.98,"Off"],[16.04,16.04,"a"],[16.16,16.44,"perky,"],[16.54,16.54,"I"],[16.74,16.82,"could"],[16.88,17.18,"probably"],[17.26,17.42,"fuck"],[17.48,17.96,"forever"],[17.98,18.32,".40"],[19.56,19.68,"on"],[19.82,19.9,"my"],[20.0,20.04,"hip,"],[20.08,20.2,"that's"],[20.24,20.6,"for"],[20.64,20.9,"whoever"],[21.56,21.88,"(Turn"],[21.94,21.96,"Me"],[22.0,22.06,"Up)"],[22.12,22.16,"He"],[22.24,22.28,"say"],[22.34,22.36,"he"],[22.44,22.62,"gon'"],[22.66,22.8,"kill"],[22.86,22.92,"me,"],[23.06,23.06,"I"],[23.18,23.32,"say"],[23.4,23.84,"“Whatever”"],[24.02,24.1,"(Jamz,"],[24.14,24.28,"Turn"],[24.46,24.48,"Me"],[24.54,24.6,"Up)"],[24.66,24.92,"Niggas"],[25.0,25.26,"talk"],[25.38,25.58,"too"],[25.76,26.04,"much,"],[26.12,26.28,"tell"],[26.32,